<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="turbo-cache-control" content="no-cache">
  <meta name="turbo-visit-control" content="reload">
<% end %>

<h1><%= @assignment.title %></h1>

<section class="pdf-preview" aria-label="教材PDFの手書き解答"
  data-controller="pdf-preview"
  data-pdf-preview-assignment-id-value="<%= @assignment.id %>"
  data-pdf-preview-url-value="<%= material_student_assignment_path(@assignment, draft_context: @draft_context) %>"
  data-pdf-preview-submission-url-value="<%= student_assignment_submission_path(@assignment) %>"
  data-pdf-preview-draft-url-value="<%= student_assignment_answer_draft_path(@assignment) %>"
  data-pdf-preview-draft-context-value="<%= @draft_context %>"
  data-pdf-preview-recovery-url-value="<%= recovery_student_assignment_answer_draft_path(@assignment) %>"
  data-pdf-preview-recovery-context-value="<%= @recovery_context %>"
  data-pdf-preview-assets-url-value="<%= request.script_name %>/vendor/pdfjs/6.4.299/"
  data-action="turbo:before-cache@document->pdf-preview#disconnect resize@window->pdf-preview#scheduleRender blur@window->pdf-preview#finishInput scroll@window->pdf-preview#scrolled beforeunload@window->pdf-preview#warnUnsaved turbo:before-visit@document->pdf-preview#confirmLeave online@window->pdf-preview#retryDraft">
  <p data-pdf-preview-target="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">問題を読み込んでいます。</p>
  <p class="pdf-preview-draft-status" data-pdf-preview-target="draftStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">下書きの復元中…</p>
  <button type="button" data-pdf-preview-target="retry" data-action="pdf-preview#retryDraft" hidden>保存を再試行</button>
  <div data-pdf-preview-target="recovery" hidden role="alert">
    <p>ログインの有効期限が切れました。答案画面を閉じず、<%= link_to "別タブで再ログイン", student_login_path, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>してください。</p>
    <button type="button" data-action="pdf-preview#resumeAnswer" data-pdf-preview-target="resume">再開を確認</button>
  </div>
  <aside class="pdf-input-diagnostics" data-pdf-preview-target="diagnostics" aria-label="開発者用入力診断" hidden>
    <strong>開発者用入力診断（この画面内のみ）</strong>
    <p>リセット後に10画書き、ペンdownと開始数を比較してください。イベントが届かない筆記は自動計測できません。</p>
    <pre class="pdf-input-diagnostics-summary" data-pdf-preview-target="diagnosticSummary" aria-live="off"></pre>
    <details>
      <summary>直近16件のイベント</summary>
      <pre data-pdf-preview-target="diagnosticEvents" aria-live="off"></pre>
    </details>
    <button type="button" data-action="pdf-preview#resetInputDiagnostics">計測リセット</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="pdf-preview#stopInputDiagnostics">診断終了</button>
  </aside>
  <div class="pdf-preview-tools" role="group" aria-label="手書きツール">
    <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-pdf-preview-target="tool"
      data-pdf-preview-tool-param="pen" data-action="pdf-preview#selectTool">ペン</button>
    <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-pdf-preview-target="tool"
      data-pdf-preview-tool-param="eraser" data-action="pdf-preview#selectTool">消しゴム</button>
    <div class="pdf-preview-sizes" data-pdf-preview-target="sizes" role="group" aria-label="消しゴムの大きさ" hidden>
      <span>消しゴムの大きさ：</span>
      <% { small: "小", medium: "中", large: "大" }.each do |size, label| %>
        <button type="button" aria-pressed="<%= size == :medium %>" data-pdf-preview-target="size"
          data-pdf-preview-size-param="<%= size %>" data-action="pdf-preview#selectSize"><%= label %></button>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div data-pdf-preview-target="container" class="pdf-preview-pages" aria-busy="true">
    <section class="pdf-preview-sheet" data-page-number="1" aria-label="教材PDFの1ページ目">
      <div class="pdf-preview-page" data-action="selectstart->pdf-preview#preventPageSelection contextmenu->pdf-preview#preventPageSelection">
        <canvas data-pdf-preview-target="canvas" aria-label="教材PDFの1ページ目" role="img" hidden></canvas>
        <canvas data-pdf-preview-target="ink" class="pdf-preview-ink" aria-label="ペン・消しゴムの手書き領域" hidden
          data-action="pointerdown->pdf-preview#pointerDown pointermove->pdf-preview#pointerMove pointerup->pdf-preview#pointerEnd pointercancel->pdf-preview#pointerEnd lostpointercapture->pdf-preview#pointerEnd pointerenter->pdf-preview#showCursor pointerleave->pdf-preview#hideCursor"></canvas>
        <span class="pdf-preview-eraser-cursor" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="pdf-preview-submit">
    <button type="button" data-pdf-preview-target="submit" data-action="pdf-preview#submitAnswer" disabled>提出する</button>
    <p data-pdf-preview-target="submitStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p role="alert">PDFの表示にはJavaScriptが必要です。ブラウザの設定を確認してください。</p></noscript>
</section>
